cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TargetIdeator, please cite this software using these metadata."
title: "TargetIdeator: evidence-grounded and falsification-aware drug target ideation"
abstract: >-
  TargetIdeator is an auditable computational system for assembling versioned
  evidence, generating drug-target hypotheses, applying fixed falsifiers, and
  reporting temporal outcome and robustness analyses with explicit provenance
  and scientific-readiness boundaries.
